  "_comment": "Per-locale article slugs. The key is the article id (= the Russian slug, which is also the ru URL). A localized URL is /blog/<locale>/<slug>.html, and /blog/<slug>.html for ru. Read by backend/scripts/blog_chrome.py (canonical, hreflang, language switcher), blog_index.py (manifest URLs) and frontend/src/hooks.server.ts (301s from the old transliterated URLs). Keep slugs ASCII, lowercase, hyphenated, no diacritics — a URL is copied, typed and logged far more often than it is read.",
